  (text_box
    "HARDWARE DESIGN & MANUFACTURING NOTES (REV E.5):\n1. POWER: 1S LiPo / Li-SOCl2 input (J2: 1=GND, 2=+VBAT, 3.0-4.35 V DC max).\n   Q3 (AO3401A) RPP feeds U3 (TPS7A0233, 25 nA Iq) and Q1 (TPS22919) -> U2.\n2. ANALOG & SMPS: FB_VDDA isolates VDDA/VREF+; L_SMPS = 15 uH power inductor\n   (Murata LQH2MCN150K02L, Isat >= 300 mA); internal 3.0 V TCXO enabled.\n3. RF & FIELD SKU: 51.9 Ohm CPWG spine, elliptic harmonic pi-filter, bare-ENIG\n   sensing comb; J1..J5 DNP on sealed field units (populate for bench/VNA)."
    (at 144.78 251.46 0)
